    <string name="set_dev_title">Quest developer setup</string>
    <string name="set_dev_message">"Tap \'Open settings\' below - this window stays open so you can follow the steps:\n\n1. ENABLE DEVELOPER OPTIONS:\n   • Go to: About headset\n   • Tap \'Build number\' 7 times\n   • Developer mode enabled!\n\n2. ENABLE WIRELESS DEBUGGING:\n   • Go back and open: System &gt; Developer options\n   • Turn on \'Wireless debugging\'\n   • Tap the LEFT SIDE of the text\n   • Choose \'Pair device with pairing code\'\n\n3. CONNECT SHIZUKU:\n   • Note the IP, port and pairing code\n   • Open the Shizuku app\n   • Enter the pairing details to connect\n\n4. AUTHORIZE APPS IN SHIZUKU:\n   • Tap \'Authorized applications\'\n   • Turn on: Orbita Launcher\n   • Turn on: ZArchiver (if you use a file manager)\n\nYour launcher will have full system access!"</string>
